From: 7T port <7t@local>
Subject: [PATCH] 0082-op7t-s3706-touch: replace Goodix driver with Synaptics S3706 for OnePlus 7T

Full replacement of bsd/dev/sweet_touch.c for SM8150 / S3706 over GENI wrap2 SE0.
Must be applied after 0060/0062/0063 (or any patch that touches this file).

--- a/bsd/dev/sweet_touch.c
+++ b/bsd/dev/sweet_touch.c
@@ -1,9 +1,17 @@
 /*
- * SWEET SE7 FIFO I2C / GT9896 Yellowstone / Focaltech 54:52 bring-up.
+ * OnePlus 7T (hotdogb, SM8150) bring-up: Synaptics S3706 touch over GENI I2C.
+ * Ported from the sweet GT9896/Focaltech driver; same polled design.
  * Call once after the scheduler is running; all work runs on one thread.
- * Requires ABL-loaded GENI I2C firmware; votes L11C through sweet_rpmh.c.
- * No firmware/config upload or direct PMIC writes. Only IC data write:
- * zero to GT9896's event status after reading a report. See touch2/report.md.
+ *
+ * Hardware from the 7T live FDT (synaptics-s3706@20 on i2c@0xc80000):
+ *   bus    qupv3 wrapper 2 SE0 (SE regs 0xc80000), I2C address 0x20,
+ *          pins gpio55/56 function qup17
+ *   rails  PM8150 L17 via RPMh (optional; ABL often leaves it on),
+ *          gpio119 1.8 V load-switch enable
+ *   reset  gpio80,  interrupt gpio122 (active low; polled as a hint)
+ *   panel  1080x2400
+ * Protocol is Synaptics RMI4: page select reg 0xff, F12 / F01 query bases
+ * discovered at probe. Requires ABL-loaded GENI I2C firmware in the SE.
  */
